From 7013a932edb765068f18dab554120d486762737a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: konsti219 <37149441+konsti219@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:40:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add Steam Frame controller interaction profile

Adds the frame_controller controller type backed by XR_VALVE_frame_controller_interaction. Games without Frame bindings keep using Touch, which the runtime remaps. Custom bindings files are now also loaded for controller types the game's manifest doesn't declare, so a framecontroller.json can add Frame bindings to any game.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
